            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="client_section_2">
            <div class="client_taital_main">
                <div class="client_left">
                    <div class="client_img"><img src="https://scontent.fdad8-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-1/432980034_1581859822577238_7556476514551851188_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s160x160_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=0ecb9b&_nc_ohc=_fwFM2i0W4EQ7kNvgEvq2hX&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent.fdad8-2.fna&_nc_gid=A6LVxnaq0mLYgWhca0IZeG3&oh=00_AYC_zQNAX19_CO6n80EdgD4cktvPg3osNet7A0MLpfuu3Q&oe=675E023C"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="client_right">
                    <h3 class="moark_text">Trần Công Hiếu</h3>
